v 3
d convertanything. Multi-format importer and converter for Stata.
d
d Walks a file or a whole folder tree and converts every csv, txt, tab,
d xls, xlsx, dta and raw file it finds into .dta, mirroring the source
d tree, optionally importing every worksheet, cleaning variable names,
d destringing and compressing.  Every file is reported as saved, skipped
d or failed, with the counts returned in r().
d
d Requires: Stata 16+.
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d Distribution-Date: 20261114
f convertanything.ado
f convertanything.sthlp
